;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"正确","text_html":"<p>正确</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"错误","text_html":"<p>错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":79,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下代码的输出是什么？\n\n```python\ncllist = CircularLinkedList()\ncllist.append(\"A\")\ncllist.prepend(\"B\")\ncllist.prepend(\"C\")\ncllist.append(\"D\")\n\ncllist.remove(\"A\")\ncllist.remove(\"C\")\nprint(cllist.head.data)\n```\n","question_text_html":"<p>以下代码的输出是什么？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">cllist = CircularLinkedList()\ncllist.append(&quot;A&quot;)\ncllist.prepend(&quot;B&quot;)\ncllist.prepend(&quot;C&quot;)\ncllist.append(&quot;D&quot;)\n\ncllist.remove(&quot;A&quot;)\ncllist.remove(&quot;C&quot;)\nprint(cllist.head.data)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"A\n","text_html":"<p>A</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"B\n","text_html":"<p>B</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"C\n","text_html":"<p>C</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"D\n","text_html":"<p>D</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":80,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"如果在一个包含$n$个元素的循环链表上运行下面的方法，其时间复杂性是多少？\n\n```python\ndef print_list(self):\n  cur = self.head \n\n  while cur:\n      print(cur.data)\n      cur = cur.next\n      if cur == self.head:\n          break\n```","question_text_html":"<p>如果在一个包含<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut